      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is only matching on DeviceArch, but not checking if it is the for the host or device, which is what resulted in the divergent behavior between different lunch targets.\n\nYou should check both for both `ctx.Device()` (which will return true if this is a device variant) and `ctx.DeviceConfig().DeviceArch()`.",
